  "system": {
    "identifier": "medical-release-chakra-transfer",
    "description": "<p>You place your hand on a creature and share your chakra with them, transferring it to them. Spend a number of Chakra die up to your proficiency bonus. When you do roll the spent die, recording the result and adding your Constitution modifier. Transfer the result to a willing creature. Chakra die spent in this way cannot be regained until you complete a long rest. If the creature is affected by a Genjutsu, they gain advantage on their next saving throw.</p>",
